Sometimes it can be so difficult to fall asleep, concentrate or just relax. Thoughts, stress and annoying sounds keep bothering us.
This app will help you achieve your goal: to distract yourself from the outside world, come to terms with yourself, get rid of unwanted thoughts.

Features:

- Collection of 70+ sounds and melodies;
- ASMR sounds and white noise;
- Cute animations to set the mood;
- Possibility to create your own mix;
- Both for adults and babies;
- Timer with a choice of playback duration.

A simple and intuitive interface will help you quickly understand the app. Just enjoy the pleasant sounds and melodies and escape from the accumulated stress.

